mily: Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size: clamp(28px,3.4vw,43px); line-height: 1.13; color: #172956;\">Ma\u00f3: a city open to the Mediterranean.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.72; color: #526074;\">Ma\u00f3 is best understood on foot. Its natural harbour, Georgian fa\u00e7ades, markets and viewpoints tell a story where Menorcans, Britons, merchants and sailors all intersect. This is a private tour, and we adapt the route to your pace.  <\/p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); grid-template-rows: 170px 170px; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 30px; border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden;\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; grid-row: 1\/3;\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Mahon20Hafen.jpg?w=800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Ma\u00f3\u2019s natural harbour\"><br><img decoding=\"async\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/visita-mahon.webp?w=800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Ma\u00f3\u2019s historic centre\"><br><img decoding=\"async\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/tour-privado-mahon.webp?w=800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Private tour of Ma\u00f3\"><\/div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr)); border-top: 1px solid #d9dde5; border-bottom: 1px solid #d9dde5; margin: 0 0 38px;\"><div style=\"padding: 17px 12px 17px 0;\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-size: 19px;\">2 hours<\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #687184;\">approximate duration<\/span><\/div><div style=\"padding: 17px 12px; border-left: 1px solid #d9dde5;\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-size: 19px;\">Private tour<\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #687184;\">just your group<\/span><\/div><div style=\"padding: 17px 0 17px 12px; border-left: 1px solid #d9dde5;\"><strong style=\"display: block; font-size: 19px;\">Santa Mar\u00eda<\/strong><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #687184;\">entry included<\/span><\/div><\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400;\">The route, told with meaning<\/h2><div style=\"display: grid; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 38px;\"><div style=\"padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #dde1e7; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #27886b; letter-spacing: 1.4px;\">01 \u00b7 PLA\u00c7A DE LA CONSTITUCI\u00d3<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 7px 0 8px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400;\">Ma\u00f3\u2019s historic heart<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">We start by the Town Hall and Santa Maria. Here we trace the city\u2019s medieval origins, its growth, and the constant relationship between the centre and the harbour. <\/p><\/div><div style=\"padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #dde1e7; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #27886b; letter-spacing: 1.4px;\">02 \u00b7 CARRERS I MIRADORS<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 7px 0 8px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400;\">The British legacy<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">Sash windows, colourful fa\u00e7ades, words and customs recall the periods of British rule in the 18th century. We also stop at the Pont de Sant Roc, a remnant of the old city walls. <\/p><\/div><div style=\"padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #dde1e7; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #27886b; letter-spacing: 1.4px;\">03 \u00b7 CLAUSTRE DEL CARME<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 7px 0 8px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400;\">Market, produce and local life<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">We go into the former Carme convent, now a market and meeting point. We talk about Menorcan cuisine, trade, and how the city is lived day to day. <\/p><\/div><div style=\"padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #dde1e7; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #27886b; letter-spacing: 1.4px;\">04 \u00b7 PORT DE MA\u00d3<\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 7px 0 8px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400;\">A harbour that changed history<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">From the viewpoints, we understand why one of the Mediterranean\u2019s great natural harbours drew fleets, merchants and European powers. Its geography explains a large part of Menorca\u2019s modern history. <\/p><\/div><\/div><div style=\"padding: 25px; border-radius: 14px; background: #172956; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 34px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 7px; color: #8ee0c6; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;\">The special moment<\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 9px; color: #fff; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 29px; font-weight: 400;\">Santa Maria and its monumental organ<\/h2><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #eef1f8; line-height: 1.65;\">We go into the church to discover its architecture and one of the island\u2019s great musical treasures: the organ built in the early 19th century, with four keyboards and more than 3,000 pipes. Admission is included. <\/p><\/div><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 34px;\"><div style=\"padding: 22px; border-radius: 12px; background: #f2f7f5;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 11px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400;\">Includes<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">\u2713 Exclusive official guide<\/p><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">\u2713 Entry to Santa Mar\u00eda<\/p><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">\u2713 Flexible itinerary<\/p><\/div><div style=\"padding: 22px; border-radius: 12px; background: #f2f7f5;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 11px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400;\">Good to know<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">Meeting point in the center<\/p><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">Walking tour with an adaptable pace<\/p><p style=\"margin: 7px 0; color: #536074;\">Transport and food and drinks not included<\/p><\/div><\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 31px; font-weight: 400;\">Group rate<\/h2><p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">The price is for the whole group, not per person. Children and babies are included. <\/p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 34px;\"><div style=\"padding: 17px; border: 1px solid #d9dde5; border-radius: 10px;\">Up to 6 people<br\/><strong style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\u20ac120<\/strong><\/div><div style=\"padding: 17px; border: 1px solid #d9dde5; border-radius: 10px;\">Up to 10 people<br\/><strong style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\u20ac150<\/strong><\/div><div style=\"padding: 17px; border: 1px solid #d9dde5; border-radius: 10px;\">Up to 20 people<br\/><strong style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\u20ac200<\/strong><\/div><\/div><div style=\"padding: 24px; border-radius: 14px; background: #f5f2eb; margin: 0 0 34px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; color: #27886b; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Keep exploring<\/p><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 400;\">Complete guide to visiting Ma\u00f3<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px; color: #586274; line-height: 1.6;\">History, hidden corners, tips and places worth knowing before or after the tour.<\/p><p><a style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 999px; background: #172956; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-mahon-menorca\/\">Read the Ma\u00f3 guide \u2192<\/a><\/p><\/div><h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: Georgia,serif; font-size: 31px; font-weight: 400;\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2><details style=\"padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #d9dde5;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;\">Can the itinerary be customized?<\/summary><p style=\"color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. Before we start, we\u2019ll talk about your interests, and during the tour we\u2019ll adjust stops and pace. <\/p><\/details><details style=\"padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #d9dde5;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;\">Is entry to Santa Mar\u00eda included?<\/summary><p style=\"color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes, entry and the guided explanation inside are part of the tour.<\/p><\/details><details style=\"padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid #d9dde5;\"><summary style=\"cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold;\">Is it suitable for children or older people?<\/summary><p style=\"color: #586274; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. We adapt the pace, stops, and explanations to the group\u2019s needs. <\/p><\/details><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-mahright e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"mahright\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1574934b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1574934b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"